{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p065a","title":"许允与崔赞有名召军曹叡时与袁侃共罪侃受重允复仕","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p065a-account","label":"《魏略》","text":"许允与崔赞有名召军曹叡时与袁侃共罪侃受重允复仕","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p065a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0069","role":"仕进受刑复官","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p065a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0091","role":"有名","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p065a-q"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0061","role":"代受重","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p065a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"许允少至嘉平六年冬","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p065a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-p065a-q","source_order":[9,637,"P065a"],"order":2368},{"id":"rensu-e-o103","title":"尚书袁侃等戒杜恕宜深待程喜，恕不以为意","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-ff82d98177d7124f8064","label":"正文","text":"尚书袁侃等戒杜恕宜深待程喜，恕不以为意","evidence":["rensu-q-ea16574da6532a06aff6"]},{"id":"rensu-a-18882223d06e8bd4db80","label":"正文","text":"杜恕至官未期，有鲜卑大人儿不由关塞径将数十骑诣州，州斩所从来小子一人，无表言上","evidence":["rensu-q-e7f8993785013243afd6"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c41564138d79c154d9a1","label":"正文","text":"程喜劾奏杜恕，下廷尉，当死","evidence":["rensu-q-be7f2fc01e7bda47b50b"]},{"id":"rensu-a-26eadc0fef7b5e086898","label":"正文","text":"以父杜畿勤事水死，杜恕免为庶人，徙章武郡；是岁嘉平元年","evidence":["rensu-q-81269195e2e1bd4e9758"]},{"id":"rensu-a-7e29e251f095f97c9277","label":"裴注·杜氏新书","text":"程喜欲杜恕折节谢己，讽司马宋权示以微意","evidence":["rensu-q-ae567296f6d1f6d2f0b7"]},{"id":"rensu-a-2ab9dfdf02e52313dc19","label":"裴注·杜氏新书","text":"杜恕答宋权书，自陈推一心直而行之，杀胡之事谓是自受无所怨咎，程征北明之亦善不明之亦善","evidence":["rensu-q-a797a72463f3ae8568a3"]},{"id":"rensu-a-9d571250c58f60e53013","label":"裴注·杜氏新书","text":"程喜于是遂深文劾杜恕","evidence":["rensu-q-8503dd14c7a4829061bb"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0061","role":"告诫者","evidence":["rensu-q-ea16574da6532a06aff6"]},{"person":"yuanzhang-p0049","role":"受诫而不以为意者；主州事之刺史；被劾当死者；免为庶人而徙章武者；被求谢己者；答书者；被劾者","evidence":["rensu-q-ea16574da6532a06aff6","rensu-q-e7f8993785013243afd6","